{
  "courseId": "voa-look-alikes-b1",
  "provider": "VOA Learning English",
  "sourceUrl": "https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/4372275.html",
  "attribution": "Source: VOA Learning English · Let's Learn English Level 2, Lesson 26: Look-alikes",
  "licenseNote": "VOA-produced Learning English content is public domain; third-party agency material is excluded.",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "voa-look-001",
      "text": "Yesterday at work, I met a woman who looks just like you.",
      "translation": "昨天在工作中，我遇到一个长得和你很像的女人。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-001.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 47.1,
      "end": 51.66,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-002",
      "text": "Wait, are you making fun of me?",
      "translation": "等等，你是在取笑我吗？",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-002.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 52.62,
      "end": 54.18,
      "duration": 1.56
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-003",
      "text": "She's tall and has curly hair.",
      "translation": "她很高，留着卷发。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-003.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 56.58,
      "end": 59.72,
      "duration": 3.14
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-004",
      "text": "I bet she has a lot of great advice.",
      "translation": "我打赌她有很多很好的建议。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-004.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 65.82,
      "end": 69.14,
      "duration": 3.32
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-005",
      "text": "We have to give her a chance.",
      "translation": "我们得给她一个机会。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-005.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 79.14,
      "end": 80.84,
      "duration": 1.7
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-006",
      "text": "We look alike, don't we?",
      "translation": "我们长得很像，对吧？",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-006.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 94.16,
      "end": 95.62,
      "duration": 1.46
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-007",
      "text": "You don't act alike.",
      "translation": "你们的行为不像。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-007.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 96.8,
      "end": 98.5,
      "duration": 1.7
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-008",
      "text": "Maybe she gets nervous at new jobs.",
      "translation": "也许她在新工作中会紧张。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-008.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 100.9,
      "end": 103.12,
      "duration": 2.22
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-009",
      "text": "Let's not judge.",
      "translation": "我们别急着评判。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-009.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 104.68,
      "end": 105.66,
      "duration": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-010",
      "text": "Oh, this is going to be fun.",
      "translation": "噢，这会很好玩。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-010.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 172.68,
      "end": 176.12,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-011",
      "text": "How much longer are you going to be?",
      "translation": "你还要多久？",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-011.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 155.8,
      "end": 158.66,
      "duration": 2.86
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-012",
      "text": "You must be Evelana.",
      "translation": "你一定是伊芙拉娜。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-012.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 161.46,
      "end": 163.52,
      "duration": 2.06
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-013",
      "text": "You had better hurry up.",
      "translation": "你最好快点。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-013.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 176.14,
      "end": 177.94,
      "duration": 1.8
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-014",
      "text": "What is all this stuff anyway?",
      "translation": "这些东西到底是什么？",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-014.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 186.4,
      "end": 188.08,
      "duration": 1.68
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-015",
      "text": "It's a fun game, but yes, it is for children.",
      "translation": "这是个有趣的游戏，但没错，它是给孩子玩的。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-015.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 194.74,
      "end": 200.2,
      "duration": 5.46
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-016",
      "text": "You may be childish, but I'm not.",
      "translation": "你可能幼稚，但我不是。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-016.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 200.96,
      "end": 203.88,
      "duration": 2.92
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-017",
      "text": "Let's go play somewhere else.",
      "translation": "我们去别的地方玩吧。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-017.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 213.12,
      "end": 215.18,
      "duration": 2.06
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-018",
      "text": "I'm going to stay for Evelana's lecture.",
      "translation": "我要留下来听伊芙拉娜的讲座。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-018.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 216.82,
      "end": 221.06,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-019",
      "text": "Do you guys have room for one more?",
      "translation": "你们还有位置再加一个人吗？",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-019.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 239.32,
      "end": 241.7,
      "duration": 2.38
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-look-020",
      "text": "We have to work with her.",
      "translation": "我们得和她一起工作。",
      "audio": "audio/voa-look-alikes-b1-020.m4a",
      "learnable": true,
      "start": 272.44,
      "end": 274.56,
      "duration": 2.12
    }
  ]
}
